            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "1Missy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I left out the peaches and added raisins. You could also use dried cranberries. Instead of mayonnaise I used Poppyseed Dressing! I love Kroger brand but I'm sure any brand would do. Also added chopped pecans. Everyone loved it!!",
            "datePublished": "2023-05-23T12:01:31.720Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
